  "description": "Fuaran.Core.Unit — a unit is a value: the runtime dimension algebra over a stated subset of UCUM (the SI base units and the gram, the SI prefixes, the SI derived units, a stated set of non-SI units) and ISO 4217 currencies, each currency a dimension of its own. One canonical text per unit, typed parse refusals naming the token and its position, `mul`/`div`/`pow`, `compatible`, and the exact conversion factor between compatible units as a rational. No project references; FSharp.Core only, Fable-clean.",
